math/ceres-solver: Add ceres-solver version 2.2.0.20251205

Ceres Solver is a library for non-linear least squares and general
optimization problems. This is the development snapshot Blender 5.2
builds against (commit 0c70ed3a, after 2.2.0), which uses Abseil
instead of glog. Built with Eigen for dense and sparse linear
algebra; without SuiteSparse, LAPACK, Accelerate sparse and CUDA.
